  "ingredients": [
    "0.5 cup butter",
    "1 cup minced celery",
    "3 tablespoons minced shallots",
    "1 quart half-and-half cream",
    "2 (12 ounce) containers fresh shucked oysters, undrained",
    "1 pinch cayenne pepper, or to taste",
    "salt and ground black pepper to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Ek2KFOYOz49uXXlKQyHW3-iMfXo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12862-Oyster-Stew-ddmfs-step-1-161-0ac1a7c99b65429e8e73dfd182795cd3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12862/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt butter in a large skillet over medium heat. Add celery and shallots; cook and stir until shallots are tender, 3 to 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/D4JqCEZ_LsT67MCO2ao_P4QMjEo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12862-Oyster-Stew-ddmfs-step-2-170-d7a5e476a445432aa2391e0d828a80a9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12862/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat half-and-half in a large pot over medium-high heat. Add celery and shallot mixture, and stir continuously until just about to boil. Add oysters and their liquid, and season with cayenne pepper, salt, and pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/GPCwkLYe5Q8suL5A8rvxPuTsFnQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12862-Oyster-Stew-ddmfs-step-4-173-90fd52591db84478b395798110c6c389.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12862/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook, stirring continuously, until oysters curl at the ends. Turn off the heat and serve immediately.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/0gOjq0wVrbK2AJxN76h0G6kWxwk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12862-Oyster-Stew-ddmfs-3x2-219-e841f364e1df496ca9668075b5ac6d23.jpg"
